VAL_ 321 TELEM_SystemState 0 "Nominal" 1 "Degraded" 2 "Safe State" 3 "Fault" ;

CM_ BO_ 576 "Canonical ECU accumulator temperatures and SoC, mirrored byte-for-byte from Telemetry CAN at 10 Hz. TTCS consumes the mapped maximum; raw 32767 is invalid. TTCS requires a new frame within 500 ms. Summary fallback provides no minimum.";
BA_ "GenMsgCycleTime" BO_ 576 100;
BA_ "GenMsgSendType" BO_ 576 0;

CM_ SG_ 576 ECU_AccuTempMax "Canonical car accumulator maximum, converted by ECU using voltage recovery and Table 5. Prefer complete fresh sweeps; if no sweep frames are fresh, use a fresh mapped summary maximum (1 degC input resolution). Partial or invalid live sweeps prevent fallback. 0x7FFF is invalid. Identical ECU_DashData bytes reach TTCS on Control CAN and screen on Telemetry/Dash CAN.";

CM_ SG_ 576 ECU_AccuTempMin "Corrected minimum from complete fresh sensor sweeps. 0x7FFF is invalid, including during summary-maximum fallback; summary supplies no minimum.";
